{
  "$schema": "../../../../packages/shared/schema/animation-scene.schema.json",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "g-02-classical-algorithms-kmeans",
  "title": { "tr": "k-means Yinelemeleri", "en": "k-means Iterations" },
  "summary": {
    "tr": "Altı nokta ve iki merkez: kötü bir rastgele başlangıçtan atama/güncelleme adımlarıyla iki yinelemede yakınsama.",
    "en": "Six points and two centroids: from a poor random start to convergence in two assign/update iterations."
  },
  "a11y": {
    "description": {
      "tr": "Tuvalde solda üç, sağda üç veri noktası vardır. İki merkez (C1 üstte ortada, C2 altta ortada) rastgele başlar. İlk atamada C1 dört nokta alır (p1, p2, p3 ve sağdaki p4), C2 iki nokta alır. Merkezler üyelerinin ortalamasına taşınır; ikinci atamada p4 C2'ye geçer. Merkezler tekrar taşınır, üçüncü atama değişmez ve algoritma durur.",
      "en": "Three data points on the left and three on the right. Two centroids (C1 top centre, C2 bottom centre) start randomly. In the first assignment C1 takes four points (p1, p2, p3 and p4 on the right) and C2 takes two. Centroids move to the mean of their members; in the second assignment p4 switches to C2. Centroids move again, the third assignment does not change and the algorithm stops."
    }
  },
  "canvas": { "width": 1000, "height": 600 },
  "nodes": [
    { "id": "p1", "kind": "generic", "label": "p1", "x": 140, "y": 150, "w": 50, "h": 40 },
    { "id": "p2", "kind": "generic", "label": "p2", "x": 260, "y": 120, "w": 50, "h": 40 },
    { "id": "p3", "kind": "generic", "label": "p3", "x": 190, "y": 320, "w": 50, "h": 40 },
    { "id": "p4", "kind": "generic", "label": "p4", "x": 720, "y": 200, "w": 50, "h": 40 },
    { "id": "p5", "kind": "generic", "label": "p5", "x": 820, "y": 330, "w": 50, "h": 40 },
    { "id": "p6", "kind": "generic", "label": "p6", "x": 680, "y": 420, "w": 50, "h": 40 },
    { "id": "c1a", "kind": "model", "label": "C1", "sublabel": "(420, 100)", "x": 420, "y": 100, "w": 70, "h": 50, "color": "primary" },
    { "id": "c2a", "kind": "model", "label": "C2", "sublabel": "(480, 520)", "x": 480, "y": 520, "w": 70, "h": 50, "color": "accent" },
    { "id": "c1b", "kind": "model", "label": "C1", "sublabel": "(328, 198)", "x": 328, "y": 198, "w": 70, "h": 50, "color": "primary" },
    { "id": "c2b", "kind": "model", "label": "C2", "sublabel": "(750, 375)", "x": 750, "y": 375, "w": 70, "h": 50, "color": "accent" },
    { "id": "c1c", "kind": "model", "label": "C1", "sublabel": "(197, 197)", "x": 197, "y": 197, "w": 70, "h": 50, "color": "primary" },
    { "id": "c2c", "kind": "model", "label": "C2", "sublabel": "(740, 317)", "x": 740, "y": 317, "w": 70, "h": 50, "color": "accent" }
  ],
  "edges": [
    { "id": "a-p1", "from": "p1", "to": "c1a", "kind": "data" },
    { "id": "a-p2", "from": "p2", "to": "c1a", "kind": "data" },
    { "id": "a-p3", "from": "p3", "to": "c1a", "kind": "data" },
    { "id": "a-p4", "from": "p4", "to": "c1a", "kind": "data" },
    { "id": "a-p5", "from": "p5", "to": "c2a", "kind": "data" },
    { "id": "a-p6", "from": "p6", "to": "c2a", "kind": "data" },
    { "id": "b-p1", "from": "p1", "to": "c1b", "kind": "data" },
    { "id": "b-p2", "from": "p2", "to": "c1b", "kind": "data" },
    { "id": "b-p3", "from": "p3", "to": "c1b", "kind": "data" },
    { "id": "b-p4", "from": "p4", "to": "c2b", "kind": "data" },
    { "id": "b-p5", "from": "p5", "to": "c2b", "kind": "data" },
    { "id": "b-p6", "from": "p6", "to": "c2b", "kind": "data" },
    { "id": "c-p1", "from": "p1", "to": "c1c", "kind": "data" },
    { "id": "c-p2", "from": "p2", "to": "c1c", "kind": "data" },
    { "id": "c-p3", "from": "p3", "to": "c1c", "kind": "data" },
    { "id": "c-p4", "from": "p4", "to": "c2c", "kind": "data" },
    { "id": "c-p5", "from": "p5", "to": "c2c", "kind": "data" },
    { "id": "c-p6", "from": "p6", "to": "c2c", "kind": "data" },
    { "id": "mv-c1-1", "from": "c1a", "to": "c1b", "kind": "control", "style": "dashed", "label": { "tr": "ortalama", "en": "mean" } },
    { "id": "mv-c2-1", "from": "c2a", "to": "c2b", "kind": "control", "style": "dashed", "label": { "tr": "ortalama", "en": "mean" } },
    { "id": "mv-c1-2", "from": "c1b", "to": "c1c", "kind": "control", "style": "dashed" },
    { "id": "mv-c2-2", "from": "c2b", "to": "c2c", "kind": "control", "style": "dashed" }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "init",
      "title": { "tr": "Rastgele başlangıç", "en": "Random initialisation" },
      "narration": {
        "tr": "k=2. İki merkez rastgele konur: C1 üstte, C2 altta — ikisi de gerçek kümelerin ortasında değil. Veride göz kararı iki grup var: sol (p1, p2, p3) ve sağ (p4, p5, p6).",
        "en": "k=2. Two centroids are placed at random: C1 at the top, C2 at the bottom — neither sits inside a real cluster. The data visibly has two groups: left (p1, p2, p3) and right (p4, p5, p6)."
      },
      "durationMs": 3000,
      "inherit": false,
      "highlight": { "nodes": ["c1a", "c2a"], "edges": [] },
      "nodeStates": {
        "c1a": { "status": "active", "badge": "init" },
        "c2a": { "status": "active", "badge": "init" },
        "c1b": { "visible": false },
        "c2b": { "visible": false },
        "c1c": { "visible": false },
        "c2c": { "visible": false }
      },
      "edgeStates": {
        "a-p1": { "visible": false }, "a-p2": { "visible": false }, "a-p3": { "visible": false },
        "a-p4": { "visible": false }, "a-p5": { "visible": false }, "a-p6": { "visible": false },
        "b-p1": { "visible": false }, "b-p2": { "visible": false }, "b-p3": { "visible": false },
        "b-p4": { "visible": false }, "b-p5": { "visible": false }, "b-p6": { "visible": false },
        "c-p1": { "visible": false }, "c-p2": { "visible": false }, "c-p3": { "visible": false },
        "c-p4": { "visible": false }, "c-p5": { "visible": false }, "c-p6": { "visible": false },
        "mv-c1-1": { "visible": false }, "mv-c2-1": { "visible": false },
        "mv-c1-2": { "visible": false }, "mv-c2-2": { "visible": false }
      },
      "annotations": [
        { "id": "init-note", "x": 560, "y": 300, "text": { "tr": "Kötü başlangıç: k-means++ bunu önler", "en": "Poor start: k-means++ avoids this" }, "tone": "warning" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "assign-1",
      "title": { "tr": "1. yineleme: atama", "en": "Iteration 1: assign" },
      "narration": {
        "tr": "Her nokta en yakın merkeze gider. p1, p2, p3 ve sağdaki p4 bile C1'e daha yakın; p5 ve p6 C2'ye. Sağ küme ikiye bölündü — henüz doğru değil.",
        "en": "Each point goes to its nearest centroid. p1, p2, p3 and even p4 on the right are closer to C1; p5 and p6 to C2. The right cluster is split — not correct yet."
      },
      "durationMs": 4000,
      "highlight": { "nodes": ["p1", "p2", "p3", "p4", "p5", "p6"], "edges": ["a-p1", "a-p2", "a-p3", "a-p4", "a-p5", "a-p6"] },
      "nodeStates": {
        "p1": { "status": "active", "badge": "C1" }, "p2": { "status": "active", "badge": "C1" },
        "p3": { "status": "active", "badge": "C1" }, "p4": { "status": "active", "badge": "C1" },
        "p5": { "status": "warning", "badge": "C2" }, "p6": { "status": "warning", "badge": "C2" },
        "c1a": { "badge": "4" }, "c2a": { "badge": "2" }
      },
      "edgeStates": {
        "a-p1": { "visible": true, "status": "active" }, "a-p2": { "visible": true, "status": "active" },
        "a-p3": { "visible": true, "status": "active" }, "a-p4": { "visible": true, "status": "active" },
        "a-p5": { "visible": true, "status": "active" }, "a-p6": { "visible": true, "status": "active" }
      },
      "packets": [
        { "edge": "a-p1", "durationMs": 900 }, { "edge": "a-p2", "durationMs": 900, "startAt": 150 },
        { "edge": "a-p3", "durationMs": 900, "startAt": 300 }, { "edge": "a-p4", "durationMs": 900, "startAt": 450, "color": "warning" },
        { "edge": "a-p5", "durationMs": 900, "startAt": 600 }, { "edge": "a-p6", "durationMs": 900, "startAt": 750 }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        { "id": "p4-note", "x": 720, "y": 120, "text": { "tr": "p4: C1'e 316, C2'ye 400 birim → C1", "en": "p4: 316 to C1, 400 to C2 → C1" }, "tone": "info", "target": "p4" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "update-1",
      "title": { "tr": "1. yineleme: merkezleri güncelle", "en": "Iteration 1: update centroids" },
      "narration": {
        "tr": "Her merkez üyelerinin ortalamasına taşınır: C1 → (328, 198), C2 → (750, 375). Bu adım küme içi kare toplamını (inertia) kesinlikle azaltır.",
        "en": "Each centroid moves to the mean of its members: C1 → (328, 198), C2 → (750, 375). This step is guaranteed to reduce the within-cluster sum of squares (inertia)."
      },
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "highlight": { "nodes": ["c1b", "c2b"], "edges": ["mv-c1-1", "mv-c2-1"] },
      "nodeStates": {
        "c1a": { "status": "muted", "badge": "" }, "c2a": { "status": "muted", "badge": "" },
        "c1b": { "visible": true, "status": "active", "badge": "it.1" },
        "c2b": { "visible": true, "status": "active", "badge": "it.1" }
      },
      "edgeStates": {
        "a-p1": { "status": "muted" }, "a-p2": { "status": "muted" }, "a-p3": { "status": "muted" },
        "a-p4": { "status": "muted" }, "a-p5": { "status": "muted" }, "a-p6": { "status": "muted" },
        "mv-c1-1": { "visible": true, "status": "active" }, "mv-c2-1": { "visible": true, "status": "active" }
      },
      "packets": [
        { "edge": "mv-c1-1", "shape": "diamond", "durationMs": 1200 },
        { "edge": "mv-c2-1", "shape": "diamond", "durationMs": 1200, "startAt": 300 }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        { "id": "inertia-1", "x": 560, "y": 300, "text": { "tr": "inertia: 412k → 198k", "en": "inertia: 412k → 198k" }, "tone": "success" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "assign-2",
      "title": { "tr": "2. yineleme: yeniden atama", "en": "Iteration 2: reassign" },
      "narration": {
        "tr": "Yeni merkezlere göre uzaklıklar tekrar ölçülür. p4 artık C2'ye (178 birim) C1'den (392 birim) çok daha yakın → küme değiştirir. Diğer atamalar aynı kalır.",
        "en": "Distances are measured again against the new centroids. p4 is now far closer to C2 (178 units) than to C1 (392 units) → it switches cluster. The other assignments stay the same."
      },
      "durationMs": 4000,
      "highlight": { "nodes": ["p4", "c1b", "c2b"], "edges": ["b-p4"] },
      "nodeStates": {
        "p4": { "status": "warning", "badge": "C2" },
        "c1b": { "badge": "3" }, "c2b": { "badge": "3" }
      },
      "edgeStates": {
        "a-p1": { "visible": false }, "a-p2": { "visible": false }, "a-p3": { "visible": false },
        "a-p4": { "visible": false }, "a-p5": { "visible": false }, "a-p6": { "visible": false },
        "mv-c1-1": { "visible": false }, "mv-c2-1": { "visible": false },
        "b-p1": { "visible": true, "status": "active" }, "b-p2": { "visible": true, "status": "active" },
        "b-p3": { "visible": true, "status": "active" }, "b-p4": { "visible": true, "status": "active", "label": { "tr": "değişti!", "en": "switched!" } },
        "b-p5": { "visible": true, "status": "active" }, "b-p6": { "visible": true, "status": "active" }
      },
      "packets": [
        { "edge": "b-p1", "durationMs": 900 }, { "edge": "b-p2", "durationMs": 900, "startAt": 150 },
        { "edge": "b-p3", "durationMs": 900, "startAt": 300 }, { "edge": "b-p4", "durationMs": 900, "startAt": 450, "color": "danger", "shape": "square" },
        { "edge": "b-p5", "durationMs": 900, "startAt": 600 }, { "edge": "b-p6", "durationMs": 900, "startAt": 750 }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        { "id": "p4-note-2", "x": 720, "y": 120, "text": { "tr": "p4: C1'e 392, C2'ye 178 → C2", "en": "p4: 392 to C1, 178 to C2 → C2" }, "tone": "warning", "target": "p4" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "update-2",
      "title": { "tr": "2. yineleme: güncelle", "en": "Iteration 2: update" },
      "narration": {
        "tr": "Merkezler tekrar ortalamaya taşınır: C1 → (197, 197) sol kümenin, C2 → (740, 317) sağ kümenin tam ortasına oturur.",
        "en": "Centroids move to the mean once more: C1 → (197, 197) sits in the middle of the left cluster, C2 → (740, 317) in the middle of the right one."
      },
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "highlight": { "nodes": ["c1c", "c2c"], "edges": ["mv-c1-2", "mv-c2-2"] },
      "nodeStates": {
        "c1a": { "visible": false }, "c2a": { "visible": false },
        "c1b": { "status": "muted", "badge": "" }, "c2b": { "status": "muted", "badge": "" },
        "c1c": { "visible": true, "status": "success", "badge": "it.2" },
        "c2c": { "visible": true, "status": "success", "badge": "it.2" }
      },
      "edgeStates": {
        "b-p1": { "status": "muted" }, "b-p2": { "status": "muted" }, "b-p3": { "status": "muted" },
        "b-p4": { "status": "muted", "label": "" }, "b-p5": { "status": "muted" }, "b-p6": { "status": "muted" },
        "mv-c1-2": { "visible": true, "status": "active" }, "mv-c2-2": { "visible": true, "status": "active" }
      },
      "packets": [
        { "edge": "mv-c1-2", "shape": "diamond", "durationMs": 1200 },
        { "edge": "mv-c2-2", "shape": "diamond", "durationMs": 1200, "startAt": 300 }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        { "id": "inertia-2", "x": 470, "y": 480, "text": { "tr": "inertia: 198k → 61k", "en": "inertia: 198k → 61k" }, "tone": "success" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "converged",
      "title": { "tr": "Yakınsama", "en": "Convergence" },
      "narration": {
        "tr": "Üçüncü atama turunda hiçbir nokta küme değiştirmez; merkezler oynamaz → algoritma durur. Sonuç başlangıca bağlı olduğundan pratikte k-means++ ile birkaç kez çalıştırılıp en düşük inertia seçilir.",
        "en": "In the third assignment round no point changes cluster and the centroids stay put → the algorithm stops. Because the result depends on the start, in practice k-means++ is run several times and the lowest inertia is kept."
      },
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "highlight": { "nodes": ["p1", "p2", "p3", "p4", "p5", "p6", "c1c", "c2c"], "edges": ["c-p1", "c-p2", "c-p3", "c-p4", "c-p5", "c-p6"] },
      "nodeStates": {
        "c1b": { "visible": false }, "c2b": { "visible": false },
        "p1": { "status": "success" }, "p2": { "status": "success" }, "p3": { "status": "success" },
        "p4": { "status": "success" }, "p5": { "status": "success" }, "p6": { "status": "success" },
        "c1c": { "badge": "✓" }, "c2c": { "badge": "✓" }
      },
      "edgeStates": {
        "b-p1": { "visible": false }, "b-p2": { "visible": false }, "b-p3": { "visible": false },
        "b-p4": { "visible": false }, "b-p5": { "visible": false }, "b-p6": { "visible": false },
        "mv-c1-2": { "visible": false }, "mv-c2-2": { "visible": false },
        "c-p1": { "visible": true, "status": "active" }, "c-p2": { "visible": true, "status": "active" },
        "c-p3": { "visible": true, "status": "active" }, "c-p4": { "visible": true, "status": "active" },
        "c-p5": { "visible": true, "status": "active" }, "c-p6": { "visible": true, "status": "active" }
      },
      "packets": [
        { "edge": "c-p1", "durationMs": 800 }, { "edge": "c-p2", "durationMs": 800, "startAt": 100 },
        { "edge": "c-p3", "durationMs": 800, "startAt": 200 }, { "edge": "c-p4", "durationMs": 800, "startAt": 300 },
        { "edge": "c-p5", "durationMs": 800, "startAt": 400 }, { "edge": "c-p6", "durationMs": 800, "startAt": 500 }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        { "id": "stop-note", "x": 480, "y": 520, "text": { "tr": "Atamalar değişmedi → dur", "en": "Assignments unchanged → stop" }, "tone": "success" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "loop": false,
  "defaultSpeed": 1,
  "tags": ["k-means", "clustering", "unsupervised"]
}
